\f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 
\par }{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 
\par }{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 \{}{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 bmc b.bmp}{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 \}}{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 \tab }{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 Run Scandisk and Defrag regularly to keep your disk in good condition.}{\plain 
\f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 
