\par }{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 \{}{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 bmc b.bmp}{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 \}}{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 \tab }{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 
Try not to load fonts that are not needed.  If you uninstall them from Control Panel, more memory becomes available, and you can always re-install the fonts if you keep them on your hard disk.}{\plain \f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 
