\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Vcl contains Delphi components placed in the public domain
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Utils contains library units placed in the public domain
\par \{bmc b.bmp\} Help contains the text and graphics used to build this file
\par \pard \s5 
