\par \pard\plain \s3\sa30 \b\f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 Bugs in previous source files
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 
A large number of corrections have been made to all files from Calmira 1.0, and the What's New topic only lists some of the more obvious flaws.  If you are using any of the code in other projects, you should check with the files in this package.
\par 
\par 
