\par }{\b 
\par }Many thanks to everyone who has contributed to Calmira, and he
lped to make it an extraordinary piece of software.  As you can imagine, a huge amount of time and effort has been put into development, but the end result wouldn't be so polished without the assistance of those who took the trouble to test out new featur
es, find bugs, provide new code and ideas, and all the others who have supported me "behind the scenes" in everyday life.
\par 
\par Finally, if you find Calmira useful, then please help me by passing a copy on to anyone who might need it -- just think how your Windows 3.1 would now feel like without it!  And of course, donations and postcards are welcome.
\par 
