\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 
\par The program distributed with this help file is Calmira Source Release 2.0, released in October 1997.  If any serious problems are discovered with this version, an update will be available as soon as possible.  Otherwise, Calmira 2.1 should be available in
 early 1998.
\par 
\par \pard\plain \s3\sa30 \b\f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 Naming convention
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 
Calmira Source Release is distributed as calmir??.zip, with a major and minor version number.  The archive from which you received version 2.0 should have been calmir20.zip, and subsequent versions will follow this convention.  
\par {\b 
\par }\pard\plain \s3\sa30 \b\f2\fs20\cf1\lang2057 World Wide Web
\par \pard\plain \s5 \f2\fs20\lang2057 
Your first stop should be Calmira's home page at where there will be links for you to download the latest version or any patches.  If that's unavailable, try the WinSite collection (which will always receive updates) or search engines that can point you i
n the right direction.
